    "body": "Blink implementer here; I have read and understood this and filed https://crbug.com/618606 . There's a bit of an open question in my mind about whether super(100, 100) will work when you're extending 'img' or super('hello', true, true) is allowable if you're extending 'option', that sort of thing. But I am pretty confident we can make anything work, within reason.\n",
