    "created_at": "2016-06-09T17:48:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-09T17:48:41Z",
    "body": "@annevk pushed a new commit with fixups and with an additional paragraph to show that you can in fact extend `Image` and friends. Let me know what you think.\n\nWe shouldn't allow people to inherit from `HTMLUnknownElement` since no native elements do, and they never will. The whole point of being an unknown element is that you're unknown, not defined...\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
