    "body": "@domenic I think the `HTMLUnknownElement` doesn't matter that much, especially if it ends up being a special case implementers have to care for. But if we really wanted to do that, I think it would make more sense to have a single inherited annotation and define the constructor such that it throws if your super is `HTMLUnknownElement`. That seems a lot more straightforward than having to carefully annotate everything except for that.\n",
